# Quiet Hours Sheet

::summary
The quiet-hours sheet (RULED 08-05), opened from the Notifications preferences pane (F-15 Delivery group): the enable toggle (toggled attr), the time window (two time inputs, 22:00 to 07:00), day chips (S M T W T F S — weekdays on by default), Save. No push during quiet hours; badges still update; urgent mentions from the owner break through.
::

::modal[name=quiet-hours title="Quiet hours" width=320 placement=centered dismissible=true]

:::row[icon=notifications action=toggleQuietHours href=# trailing-label="On" trailing-action=toggleQuietHours]
Quiet hours — ON
No push during quiet hours; badges still update; urgent mentions from the owner break through
:::

:::form[name=quiet-window submit="Save" action=saveQuietHours]
- Start (text, "22:00")
- End (text, "07:00")
:::

:::toolbar
- button[label="S" action=toggleQuietDay toggled=false]
- button[label="M" action=toggleQuietDay toggled=true]
- button[label="T" action=toggleQuietDay toggled=true]
- button[label="W" action=toggleQuietDay toggled=true]
- button[label="T" action=toggleQuietDay toggled=true]
- button[label="F" action=toggleQuietDay toggled=true]
- button[label="S" action=toggleQuietDay toggled=false]
:::

::

Top-right ✕ per dismiss canon. Save is the form's submit, so it renders with the window fields; the reviewed order keeps Save last after the day chips (button placement is renderer polish). The window fields carry the current 22:00–07:00 values as placeholders (prefill is state layer).

## Renderer notes (consciously deferred)

- Day chips render as toggled toolbar buttons; the shipped control is the multi-select pill-chip strip — suggestion-chips treatment, deferred to the block round. This is a MULTI-select set (each day toggles independently; weekdays on together), NOT single-select — so the tree's segmented-control conversion (search scope, filter facets) does NOT apply here; toggled buttons are the correct idiom until the pill-chip block lands.
- The shipped time fields are typed time inputs; the form grammar has no time kind yet, so plain text fields stand in.

At small width (≤ 767px, R-C ruling 08-10) the sheet goes edge-to-edge with 10px side insets and auto width; the wide placement declared on the block is unchanged.
